        {
          "id": 11100000031676,
          "type": "Comment",
          "author_id": 11100000023757,
          "body": "Many frustrations and questions here.\n\n---------- Forwarded message ---------\nFrom: Jane Requester <jane.requester@example.com>\nDate: Thu, Mar 5, 2026 at 1:36 PM\nSubject: Lookup for Widget\nTo: Sam Forwarder <sam.forwarder@example.com>\n\n\nSam,\n\n1) Can you tell me if I'm doing something wrong? When I search for a widget to see what items it has, it doesn't bring up just that widget and its items - it brings up a bunch that are unrelated. It is so frustrating!\n\n2) And then, as I scroll through all the items, it only shows 3 of the 4 live items that the widget has. I keep trying to link the other item but it won't pull up the widget, XYZ Now.\n\n3) And...if a listing is edited, does the link and code change from the original listing?\n\n4) How do I change the author of an item?\n\n5) We seem to have problems when using \"repeating\" on an item so for the past while we have only used \"ongoing.\" Should we never use \"repeating\" or how should it be used properly?\n\n6) What is the purpose of the \"Approval\" button and who should be approving widgets? Is there any value in it?\n\nJane Requester\nCinnamon Chapter Coordinator\nVanilla County, Example Township, Sample City, Placeholder\n555-010-1234\n\nacme-serve.example\n\nGrowing Together Through Example Engagement",
          "html_body": "<div class=\"zd-comment zd-comment-pre-styled\" dir=\"auto\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Many frustrations and questions here.<br><br>---------- Forwarded message ---------<br>From: Jane Requester &lt;jane.requester@example.com&gt;<br>Date: Thu, Mar 5, 2026 at 1:36 PM<br>Subject: Lookup for Widget<br>To: Sam Forwarder &lt;sam.forwarder@example.com&gt;<br><br><div>Sam,</div><div>1) Can you tell me if I'm doing something wrong? When I search for a widget to see what items it has, it doesn't bring up just that widget and its items - it brings up a bunch that are unrelated. It is so frustrating!</div><div>2) And then, as I scroll through all the items, it only shows 3 of the 4 live items that the widget has. I keep trying to link the other item but it won't pull up the widget, XYZ Now.</div><div>3) And...if a listing is edited, does the link and code change from the original listing?</div><div>4) How do I change the author of an item?</div><div>5) We seem to have problems when using \"repeating\" on an item so for the past while we have only used \"ongoing.\" Should we never use \"repeating\" or how should it be used properly?</div><div>6) What is the purpose of the \"Approval\" button and who should be approving widgets? Is there any value in it?</div><div>Jane Requester<br>Cinnamon Chapter Coordinator<br>Vanilla County, Example Township, Sample City, Placeholder<br>555-010-1234<br><br>acme-serve.example<br><br>Growing Together Through Example Engagement</div></div></div>",
          "plain_body": "Many frustrations and questions here.\n\n---------- Forwarded message ---------\nFrom: Jane Requester <jane.requester@example.com>\nDate: Thu, Mar 5, 2026 at 1:36 PM\nSubject: Lookup for Widget\nTo: Sam Forwarder <sam.forwarder@example.com>\n\n\nSam,\n\n1) Can you tell me if I'm doing something wrong? When I search for a widget to see what items it has, it doesn't bring up just that widget and its items - it brings up a bunch that are unrelated. It is so frustrating!\n\n2) And then, as I scroll through all the items, it only shows 3 of the 4 live items that the widget has. I keep trying to link the other item but it won't pull up the widget, XYZ Now.\n\n3) And...if a listing is edited, does the link and code change from the original listing?\n\n4) How do I change the author of an item?\n\n5) We seem to have problems when using \"repeating\" on an item so for the past while we have only used \"ongoing.\" Should we never use \"repeating\" or how should it be used properly?\n\n6) What is the purpose of the \"Approval\" button and who should be approving widgets? Is there any value in it?\n\nJane Requester\nCinnamon Chapter Coordinator\nVanilla County, Example Township, Sample City, Placeholder\n555-010-1234\n\nacme-serve.example\n\nGrowing Together Through Example Engagement",
          "public": true,
          "attachments": [],
          "audit_id": 11100000007919
        },
