        {
          "id": 11100000324679,
          "type": "Comment",
          "author_id": 11100000205894,
          "body": "These are great questions and very valid frustrations. I will get answers to these documented quickly. I'll reach out when those are written.\n\nAs far as the widget search frustrations, I know we have a new search algorithm in development for the item searches - but nothing for the widget search. I will dig into the widget searches to see how we're missing the mark. Once I can identify what is going wrong with the widget searches I can propose changes to that search as well. Do you mind if I reach out to Jane and ask her further questions on the widget search and her frustrations?\n\nBest,\nAlex Agent\nAcme Serve Help Desk Lead",
          "html_body": "<div class=\"zd-comment\" dir=\"auto\">These are great questions and very valid frustrations. I will get answers to these documented quickly. I'll reach out when those are written.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>As far as the widget search frustrations, I know we have a new search algorithm in development for the item searches - but nothing for the widget search. I will dig into the widget searches to see how we're missing the mark. Once I can identify what is going wrong with the widget searches I can propose changes to that search as well. Do you mind if I reach out to Jane and ask her further questions on the widget search and her frustrations?<br><span class=\"collapse-signature\"></span><div class=\"signature\"><p dir=\"auto\">Best,<br>Alex Agent<br>Acme Serve Help Desk Lead</p></div></div>",
          "plain_body": "These are great questions and very valid frustrations. I will get answers to these documented quickly. I'll reach out when those are written.\n\nAs far as the widget search frustrations, I know we have a new search algorithm in development for the item searches - but nothing for the widget search. I will dig into the widget searches to see how we're missing the mark. Once I can identify what is going wrong with the widget searches I can propose changes to that search as well. Do you mind if I reach out to Jane and ask her further questions on the widget search and her frustrations?\n\nBest,\nAlex Agent\nAcme Serve Help Desk Lead",
          "public": true,
